    "api_info" : {
      "title" : "Save",
      "description" : "Creates or updates a tool in the tool registry. This operation allows defining tool metadata, execution details, schema, and access control. If a UUID is provided, the existing tool is updated; otherwise, a new tool is created and registered in the system.\n\nInput Parameters:\nuuid (string): Unique identifier of the tool (used for updating an existing tool).\nname (string): Name of the tool.\ndescription (string): Description of the tool and its functionality.\nsource (string): Source or origin of the tool (e.g., internal, external).\nfqn (string): Fully Qualified Name representing the tool’s execution path.\nschema (object/string): Defines the input/output structure of the tool.\nstaticPayload (object/string): Predefined static payload associated with the tool.\nstatus (string): Status of the tool (e.g., active/inactive).\nmcpId (string): Identifier of the MCP associated with the tool.\nagentAccess (string): Defines access level of the tool (e.g., public/private).\nactive (boolean): Indicates whether the tool is enabled for use.\n\nOutput Parameters:\nuuid (string): Unique identifier of the created or updated tool.\nstatus (string): Status of the operation (e.g., success or failure).\nerror (string): Error message in case the operation fails."
    },
